      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Nate and Chriselle Dwarika also use a variety of more traditional content creation tools — all accelerated by RTX. For video content, Nate Dwarika captures footage on OBS Studio using the NVIDIA encoder ( NVENC ) built into his GeForce RTX 4090 GPU. Because NVENC is a separate encoder, the rest of the GPU can focus on resource-intensive ComfyUI workflows without reducing performance, all while maintaining top encoding quality.",
